WEBVTT

01:43.880 --> 01:45.280
So pretty.

01:45.840 --> 01:47.040
What are you looking at?

02:09.479 --> 02:11.360
Dad, Mom.

02:14.360 --> 02:16.880
This girl is even prettier than Qingli.

02:22.640 --> 02:23.880
Dad, Mom.

03:46.040 --> 03:47.160
Who is this?

03:47.240 --> 03:48.600
An unfamiliar alum.

03:54.120 --> 03:57.240
Such a good girl.
Why did she make herself look so bad?

03:59.360 --> 04:00.520
Look at the blush.

04:01.160 --> 04:03.120
Especially the eyeshadow.

04:03.200 --> 04:05.600
How can eyeshadow have such a bad effect?

04:05.680 --> 04:06.720
THOUSAND BIRDS COLLECTION

04:10.480 --> 04:12.880
The consumer data of CBNData shows

04:13.600 --> 04:15.440
that since 2017,

04:15.520 --> 04:17.880
the women's sports market
has been expanding.

04:17.959 --> 04:20.880
Women with fitness habits make up 72%.

04:20.959 --> 04:25.040
Eighty percent of women
exercise more than twice a week.

04:25.640 --> 04:26.960
Among fitness enthusiasts,

04:27.040 --> 04:30.920
32.5% are women aged 19 to 24,

04:31.000 --> 04:33.720
and this proportion is rising.

04:33.800 --> 04:36.680
What does the sports product consumption
have to do with us?

04:38.440 --> 04:41.440
Women now demand more stable makeup.

04:43.760 --> 04:47.520
When sports and outdoor activities
become part of their daily life,

04:47.600 --> 04:49.080
no one wants to look like this.

04:53.760 --> 04:55.280
Before launching the product,

04:55.360 --> 04:58.200
test the data related
to makeup stability again.

04:58.280 --> 04:59.960
Let the Marketing Department note this.

05:02.240 --> 05:03.760
But the time…

05:07.440 --> 05:08.360
Fine.

05:09.080 --> 05:11.080
I love work. I love overtime.

05:26.560 --> 05:28.320
Why are you up so early?

05:28.400 --> 05:30.320
Those who don't work
should be considerate.

05:30.920 --> 05:34.040
Don't occupy public resources
during busy hours.

05:34.120 --> 05:36.760
I'm also trying to find a job, okay?

05:47.760 --> 05:50.600
Look at you,
not even bothering to tidy yourself up.

05:50.680 --> 05:52.320
Your face is oily enough to fry food.

05:57.120 --> 05:59.480
Go. I need to use the mirror now.

06:15.000 --> 06:18.800
Since you're at home unemployed,
you should study how to dress up.

06:18.880 --> 06:20.600
Dress yourself up.

06:20.680 --> 06:23.200
It's fine if you can't find a man,

06:23.280 --> 06:25.280
but it's deadly if you can't find a job.

06:27.880 --> 06:30.920
- Why did you take a picture of me?
- You look so bad.

06:33.640 --> 06:35.560
Is it my fault
I don't look as good as you?

06:35.640 --> 06:37.720
Is it impressive that you're handsome?
It's because of your parents.

06:37.800 --> 06:39.400
It's their genes.

06:41.840 --> 06:45.480
What are you doing?
I'm beautiful, not handsome.

07:00.400 --> 07:02.560
Who doesn't want to look better?

07:02.640 --> 07:04.280
I want to be beautiful too.

07:11.040 --> 07:15.200
THOUSAND BIRDS COLLECTION

07:28.600 --> 07:30.600
Gu, how's it going?

07:31.200 --> 07:33.960
Don't worry.
I checked the process last night.

07:34.760 --> 07:36.560
- There's no problem at all.
- Good.

07:42.920 --> 07:43.760
Hello.

07:45.800 --> 07:47.000
Change the shooting schedule?

07:48.600 --> 07:49.680
Absolutely not.

07:49.760 --> 07:51.280
What? Cancel the shoot?

07:52.800 --> 07:54.240
Hello? Hello?

07:55.200 --> 07:56.360
What happened?

07:56.960 --> 07:59.320
The celebrity for today's shoot
had nose surgery.

07:59.400 --> 08:01.520
There's been a complication.
She's not fully recovered yet.

08:02.360 --> 08:04.280
They suddenly notified us
to cancel the poster shoot.

08:04.360 --> 08:05.840
They're willing to pay the penalty fee.

08:07.120 --> 08:08.840
Is this about the penalty fee?

08:11.280 --> 08:13.520
This is our company's
first new product this year.

08:13.600 --> 08:15.480
If the promotional poster
can't go live on time,

08:15.560 --> 08:17.440
all the subsequent work will be ruined.

08:21.560 --> 08:23.000
Why would this happen?

08:26.040 --> 08:27.720
We can use an ordinary girl instead.

08:31.000 --> 08:32.039
No way.

08:32.120 --> 08:33.240
We're a new company.

08:33.320 --> 08:35.320
Using an ordinary girl
will lower product attention.

08:35.400 --> 08:37.200
In the early stages,

08:37.280 --> 08:38.559
we have no brand reputation.

08:38.640 --> 08:40.000
It's hard to sign good celebrities.

08:40.080 --> 08:43.039
Besides, a product poster is different
from a brand ambassador.

08:43.120 --> 08:44.600
It should focus more
on the product's features.

08:45.200 --> 08:46.280
You don't understand the market.

08:46.360 --> 08:49.760
I may not understand the market,
but I understand the product.

08:50.720 --> 08:52.840
The foundation of the market
is the product.

08:52.920 --> 08:56.200
Our product's positioning
is affordable, high-quality cosmetics,

08:56.280 --> 08:58.760
encouraging ordinary women
to discover and create beauty.

08:58.840 --> 09:01.120
So, using an amateur model
is more convincing.

09:01.200 --> 09:02.560
Ordinary women?

09:07.400 --> 09:09.280
You're not going
to just pick anyone, right?

09:15.520 --> 09:18.920
They must have some unique features
to showcase the product,

09:19.000 --> 09:21.160
attract attention,
and stimulate purchases.

09:24.600 --> 09:26.720
To put it simply,
you want ordinary people,

09:26.800 --> 09:27.680
but they must be pretty.

09:28.640 --> 09:30.200
That's even harder
than finding a celebrity.

09:30.280 --> 09:31.440
Alright, alright.

09:32.040 --> 09:33.040
How about this?

09:33.640 --> 09:35.120
We can't shoot today anyway.

09:35.200 --> 09:36.280
Everyone, let's work separately.

09:36.360 --> 09:38.760
The Marketing Department
should keep searching

09:38.840 --> 09:40.480
for a suitable celebrity.

09:40.560 --> 09:42.160
The rest of you can go find

09:43.840 --> 09:46.160
an ordinary girl
who meets Mr. Tang's requirements.

09:46.240 --> 09:47.120
It's settled.

10:03.440 --> 10:04.400
Thanks for coming.

10:04.480 --> 10:05.840
Please wait for the news at home.

10:20.840 --> 10:27.440
INBOX

10:30.600 --> 10:33.880
DEAR YUAN

10:35.240 --> 10:36.080
Hello.

10:36.160 --> 10:37.880
Chengcheng, come over now.

10:37.960 --> 10:40.040
Tang Qi is with me.
He wants to apologize to you.

10:40.640 --> 10:43.320
Tang Qi is apologizing to me?

10:43.400 --> 10:45.200
I've sent you the address. Hurry up.

10:47.440 --> 10:48.440
Okay.

10:55.680 --> 10:57.080
I heard you're starting a business.

10:57.160 --> 10:58.200
This is a warehouse.

10:58.280 --> 10:59.800
You can use it rent-free for three years.

10:59.880 --> 11:02.040
No, five years for you.

11:02.120 --> 11:05.040
Consider it a little support
for your career from me.

11:05.120 --> 11:07.280
My grandpa got compensated for
the demolition and left me a few houses.

11:07.360 --> 11:08.520
We're friends after all.

11:11.280 --> 11:12.520
I'm also a local.

11:15.560 --> 11:18.280
Doing business isn't easy. No one
will ever have too many warehouses.

11:19.640 --> 11:20.560
What's going on?

11:20.640 --> 11:22.480
When Chengcheng comes later,

11:22.560 --> 11:24.840
can you say that you offered
to apologize to her?

11:25.920 --> 11:29.400
After all, you took a photo
while a girl felt embarrassed.

11:29.480 --> 11:30.760
That was offensive.

11:32.200 --> 11:34.400
Before the photo, I asked
Su Chengcheng for her consent.

11:35.000 --> 11:36.360
But you said she looked bad.

11:36.440 --> 11:39.960
I was just stating the facts objectively.

11:43.480 --> 11:45.680
Since you don't want
to apologize in person,

11:45.760 --> 11:49.120
how about friending
Su Chengcheng on WeChat

11:49.200 --> 11:51.000
and leaving a message to say sorry?

11:51.080 --> 11:53.720
Just two words, "I'm sorry."

11:55.280 --> 11:56.520
Is that okay?

11:59.600 --> 12:02.840
Instead of saying those fake words
to try to fool her,

12:02.920 --> 12:05.080
why don't you make Su Chengcheng reflect

12:05.160 --> 12:07.600
on why she made herself look so messy?

12:15.600 --> 12:18.840
Senior Tang, Su Chengcheng
is the most beautiful girl I've ever met.

12:18.920 --> 12:20.560
You only focus on the outside.

12:20.640 --> 12:22.920
You don't even know what real beauty is.

12:23.000 --> 12:25.960
Forget it. Why am I even saying this
to someone blind like you?

12:26.040 --> 12:28.840
Anyway, you must apologize today,

12:28.920 --> 12:31.080
or you won't be able to leave this café.

12:33.920 --> 12:35.600
Appearance is natural.

12:35.680 --> 12:38.160
How should I reflect?

12:38.720 --> 12:42.400
Should I reflect as an unambitious embryo?

12:42.960 --> 12:45.680
My sister inherited all the good traits
of our parents,

12:45.760 --> 12:48.160
- but I didn't.
- Where are we going tonight?

12:48.720 --> 12:50.320
What do you want to eat?

12:53.320 --> 12:54.920
What's wrong, sweetie?

12:55.000 --> 12:56.280
Let me check.

12:56.360 --> 12:57.400
Did you wet yourself?

12:57.480 --> 13:01.080
- Mom, balloon!
- Alright, just wait a moment.

13:02.800 --> 13:04.120
Balloon!

13:04.200 --> 13:09.480
Balloon! Balloon! Balloon!

13:19.480 --> 13:23.320
Balloon! Balloon!

14:02.760 --> 14:04.480
How are you? Are you okay?

14:04.560 --> 14:05.640
- Are you hurt?
- Are you okay?

14:06.880 --> 14:09.400
Be careful next time.
Don't walk in the middle of the road.

14:09.480 --> 14:10.400
Got it?

14:13.400 --> 14:15.600
- Say thank you.
- Thank you.

14:15.680 --> 14:16.520
- No problem.
- Thanks.

14:16.600 --> 14:17.840
- No problem.
- Goodbye.

14:17.920 --> 14:18.960
Goodbye.

14:20.280 --> 14:22.440
Miss, your shoe.

14:58.800 --> 15:00.000
Thank you.

15:00.080 --> 15:01.320
Miss, are you alright?

15:01.400 --> 15:02.720
Do you need to go to the hospital?

15:04.200 --> 15:07.040
I'm fine. It's just a scratch.
It'll heal in a few days.

15:22.440 --> 15:24.720
Miss. Miss.

15:29.760 --> 15:32.480
Would you like to be a model
for a poster shoot?

15:35.400 --> 15:36.520
Are you crazy…

15:51.160 --> 15:52.960
Our company is looking
for an amateur model

15:53.040 --> 15:54.080
to shoot product posters.

15:54.160 --> 15:56.600
Your image and temperament
are perfect for it.

15:56.680 --> 15:57.520
I'm not a fraud.

15:58.120 --> 16:00.120
You can visit our company
before you decide.

16:02.400 --> 16:03.680
My name is Tang Qi.

16:09.360 --> 16:11.040
This is my contact info.

16:11.120 --> 16:12.560
Please contact me.

16:13.080 --> 16:16.360
What do you think of my face now?

16:19.000 --> 16:19.960
You're…

16:22.080 --> 16:22.960
very beautiful.

16:28.760 --> 16:30.280
I'm not dreaming.

16:32.840 --> 16:34.320
I'm not dreaming.

16:38.320 --> 16:39.840
Please contact me.

17:05.119 --> 17:06.240
The last one

17:06.319 --> 17:08.280
is the most suitable candidate
in our opinion.

17:08.359 --> 17:10.920
She's 22 years old,
a student at the Foreign Language College,

17:11.000 --> 17:12.200
good at singing and dancing.

17:12.280 --> 17:14.599
She loves outdoor sports, and, notably,

17:14.680 --> 17:16.760
she's published two translated works

17:16.839 --> 17:18.560
and participated in marathons.

17:18.640 --> 17:19.599
She has a healthy image,

17:19.680 --> 17:21.200
a sunny temperament,
and an independent spirit.

17:21.280 --> 17:23.160
She's in line
with the current female aesthetic.

17:27.640 --> 17:29.240
I think the last one is great too.

17:29.320 --> 17:31.480
She's perfect
for our product's positioning.

17:31.560 --> 17:32.400
No.

17:34.880 --> 17:37.320
Neither celebrities
nor ordinary girls work for you.

17:37.400 --> 17:38.680
What exactly do you want?

17:45.480 --> 17:48.600
This is the most suitable model
in my eyes.

17:51.720 --> 17:53.640
What's this scar on her face?

17:55.640 --> 17:57.040
A medal of her beautiful soul.

18:01.080 --> 18:04.360
Are you planning to use
a virtual character for our poster model?

18:05.440 --> 18:06.640
I've seen her in person.

18:11.280 --> 18:13.360
How about letting her try?

18:14.000 --> 18:17.200
Mr. Tang, when can this lady
come for the audition?

18:19.440 --> 18:21.120
I'm waiting for her call.

18:22.280 --> 18:23.440
What's her name?

18:23.520 --> 18:24.960
Please send me her phone number.

18:25.040 --> 18:26.240
I'll contact her immediately.

18:28.560 --> 18:29.400
I don't know.

18:32.040 --> 18:33.440
Mr. Tang, are you saying

18:33.520 --> 18:37.520
that you don't know her name
or her contact info?

18:40.080 --> 18:40.920
Yes.

18:41.000 --> 18:43.040
So, what do you know?

18:53.000 --> 18:54.400
Based on this clue,

18:56.920 --> 18:57.880
go find her.

19:03.040 --> 19:05.280
How could you be Su Chengcheng?

19:05.880 --> 19:07.760
I am Su Chengcheng.

19:08.520 --> 19:11.920
You can change your face
because of this bracelet?

19:12.000 --> 19:15.520
Aside from that,
I can't think of any other reason.

19:18.280 --> 19:20.360
Why can't I take it off?

19:30.680 --> 19:32.920
Where's the old lady who gave it to you?

19:33.000 --> 19:35.920
Didn't you say you were going to find
the old lady who gave it to you?

19:38.280 --> 19:40.760
Sir, excuse me.

19:40.840 --> 19:43.800
Where did the old lady
who was selling flowers here go?

19:43.880 --> 19:45.200
Old lady?

19:45.280 --> 19:46.400
I've never seen her.

19:47.440 --> 19:50.800
I passed by here last night
and bought flowers.

19:50.880 --> 19:52.880
I've never seen her. You must be mistaken.

19:52.960 --> 19:55.000
This area doesn't allow street vendors.

19:59.040 --> 20:01.080
Do you think I'm gullible?

20:02.160 --> 20:04.440
Do you think telling me some secrets
between Chengcheng and me

20:04.520 --> 20:06.960
that you found somehow would make me
believe you're Su Chengcheng?

20:07.040 --> 20:08.800
- I--
- You're so pretty.

20:08.880 --> 20:10.760
Why are you a fraud?

20:14.520 --> 20:16.080
I'm sorry. I was too anxious.

20:16.160 --> 20:17.840
But believe me.

20:17.920 --> 20:19.640
I'm really Su Chengcheng.

20:24.080 --> 20:25.640
You're so strong.

20:26.240 --> 20:27.960
Chengcheng has been strong
since she was little.

20:28.040 --> 20:30.240
If Mrs. Su hadn't opposed it,

20:30.320 --> 20:31.880
Chengcheng almost went
to practice weightlifting.

20:37.480 --> 20:39.320
You. Come with me.

20:51.400 --> 20:52.480
Trust me.

20:52.560 --> 20:53.440
I--

20:54.320 --> 20:55.920
Prove to me you're Su Chengcheng.

20:56.000 --> 20:57.040
If you're Chengcheng,

20:57.120 --> 20:59.520
even if your fingerprints change,
the password won't.

21:00.040 --> 21:02.560
The password is our birth year

21:02.640 --> 21:06.000
plus our birthdays
in the Chinese Calendar.

21:06.080 --> 21:07.200
98--

21:09.120 --> 21:10.640
981618.

21:25.400 --> 21:26.920
My fingerprints haven't changed.

21:28.560 --> 21:31.880
- You really are Chengcheng.
- I really am.

21:40.400 --> 21:41.280
Let's go.

21:51.600 --> 21:53.520
Ow. Ow, ow, ow.

22:08.400 --> 22:09.680
Ow, ow, ow.

22:11.240 --> 22:12.680
If you keep messing with it,

22:12.760 --> 22:15.000
the bracelet won't come off,
but your hand will be broken.

22:16.840 --> 22:19.360
Don't worry. We'll think of another way.

22:42.880 --> 22:45.560
Your fingerprint hasn't changed.
Your weight hasn't changed.

22:45.640 --> 22:47.080
Only your voice and face have changed.

23:10.720 --> 23:12.640
Are you sure it's because of the bracelet?

23:15.200 --> 23:16.320
I'm sure.

23:18.680 --> 23:21.520
But we can't find the old lady
who sells flowers now.

23:21.600 --> 23:23.480
I don't know what's going on.

23:26.800 --> 23:28.920
Could the old lady be a fairy?

23:30.320 --> 23:31.720
Heaven and earth, please help us.

23:31.800 --> 23:33.960
Bracelet Fairy, show yourself.

23:42.960 --> 23:44.200
Why don't you use your blood?

23:44.280 --> 23:45.880
It's a setting in those fantasy stories.

23:45.960 --> 23:48.120
Once you swear in blood,
you can open up a space.

24:07.680 --> 24:09.640
BEAUTY FILTER, OUTFIT, EFFECT

24:21.960 --> 24:24.120
Can you see a control panel?

24:26.200 --> 24:27.080
Where?

24:27.720 --> 24:29.400
Right here. Right here.

24:32.320 --> 24:33.560
I can't see anything.

24:34.640 --> 24:36.000
What's on the panel?

24:40.000 --> 24:42.840
It looks like an interface.

24:47.960 --> 24:49.160
Close.

24:49.760 --> 24:51.360
CLOSE

24:59.760 --> 25:02.640
You've changed back!

25:04.480 --> 25:05.400
Let me see.

25:09.240 --> 25:10.880
You've finally changed back.

25:10.960 --> 25:12.840
The previous look was beautiful,

25:12.920 --> 25:16.120
but this is the Su Chengcheng
I grew up with.

25:16.920 --> 25:19.360
I had always wanted to be pretty.

25:19.440 --> 25:20.680
But when it came true today,

25:21.320 --> 25:22.800
I realized I actually didn't want it.

25:22.880 --> 25:24.240
It scared me out of my wits.

25:24.840 --> 25:26.200
Fortunately, you can change back.

25:26.280 --> 25:27.200
Try again.

25:27.280 --> 25:28.360
I'll try again.

25:33.600 --> 25:35.520
VOICE CHANGE, BEAUTY FILTER
OUTFIT, EFFECT, AUTO

25:42.200 --> 25:43.640
START

25:52.400 --> 25:54.800
- How's that?
- You can change freely!

25:55.640 --> 25:56.920
Su Chengcheng!

26:00.840 --> 26:02.280
‪TURN OFF

26:02.360 --> 26:06.080
You've won the lottery!

26:07.680 --> 26:09.400
- Let me try again.
- Go on.

26:13.680 --> 26:16.560
FULL SCREEN

26:16.640 --> 26:18.760
EFFECT, AUTO

26:21.040 --> 26:23.240
It can even enlarge.

26:23.320 --> 26:26.440
CLOSE, VOICE CHANGE, BEAUTY FILTER
OUTFIT, EFFECT

26:29.240 --> 26:30.400
Where?

26:30.480 --> 26:31.520
In front of you.

26:35.600 --> 26:36.640
MAKEUP, HAIR, EYEBROW SHAPING
SCAR REMOVAL

26:38.920 --> 26:40.520
FLAW CORRECTION

26:49.760 --> 26:50.600
Ow.

26:51.200 --> 26:52.480
Sorry, sorry.

26:53.120 --> 26:55.040
Looks like the wound is still there,

26:55.120 --> 26:56.600
but it's just invisible.

26:56.680 --> 26:58.160
So magical!

26:58.680 --> 27:01.080
It's just using light and shadow
to deceive the eyes,

27:01.160 --> 27:02.960
but it doesn't change the reality.

27:10.760 --> 27:12.200
Here's another button.

27:12.920 --> 27:13.960
VOICE CHANGE

27:18.520 --> 27:22.840
SWEET, COOL, LOLI, DELICATE

27:24.920 --> 27:26.800
LOLI

27:27.360 --> 27:30.000
It can adjust the voice.

27:34.760 --> 27:35.760
My voice.

27:39.720 --> 27:41.320
HOARSE

27:41.400 --> 27:43.640
It really can change the voice.

27:46.800 --> 27:50.760
This is just a super beauty filter
with a voice changer!

27:50.840 --> 27:54.080
Its function panel looks like a filter.

27:54.680 --> 27:56.840
Try the other functions.

27:56.920 --> 27:57.760
I'll try it.

28:01.760 --> 28:02.800
OUTFIT

28:03.360 --> 28:06.520
TRENDY, CASUAL

28:09.560 --> 28:10.800
TRENDY

28:10.880 --> 28:14.840
WORK

28:14.920 --> 28:18.880
TRENDY, COSPLAY, VACATION

28:18.960 --> 28:20.880
Oh my God.

28:20.960 --> 28:23.000
CASUAL, SPORTS

29:02.960 --> 29:05.480
You don't even need to buy clothes.

29:07.680 --> 29:09.360
I can even change my makeup.

29:17.000 --> 29:18.840
You changed again.

29:25.880 --> 29:29.000
So cool!

30:24.760 --> 30:25.800
Chengcheng,

30:26.520 --> 30:29.760
this is a super gift from the old lady.

30:34.920 --> 30:36.320
From today on,

30:36.920 --> 30:39.240
the old Su Chengcheng is dead.

30:39.320 --> 30:43.400
I am the beautiful Chengcheng now.

30:44.000 --> 30:44.840
Hello?

30:44.920 --> 30:46.880
Is there a female member?

30:46.960 --> 30:48.440
About 20 years old and 1.7 meters tall.

30:49.400 --> 30:51.240
Well-proportioned, very beautiful.

30:51.320 --> 30:54.920
She's agile and strong.

30:56.120 --> 30:58.360
Yes, she should come to your gym often.

30:58.440 --> 31:00.200
She's your VIP client.

31:01.440 --> 31:05.480
She carries a gym-branded bag.
It's No. 062.

31:13.160 --> 31:14.960
Got it.

31:15.040 --> 31:17.400
I understand
you can't leak any client info.

31:18.120 --> 31:19.160
Okay.

31:22.400 --> 31:23.920
The gym has confirmed

31:24.000 --> 31:26.480
that our target
is indeed their VIP client,

31:26.560 --> 31:29.880
but they won't disclose her info.

31:32.160 --> 31:35.600
Well. I'll go there
and try to get her contact info.

31:37.040 --> 31:37.960
Okay.

31:51.120 --> 31:53.920
Tang, don't go on a wild goose chase.

31:54.000 --> 31:55.400
You'll just waste time and energy.

31:55.960 --> 31:59.200
One of my ex-girlfriends
has been lucky lately.

31:59.280 --> 32:02.440
One of her artists
suddenly became famous overnight

32:02.520 --> 32:04.760
with a low-budget web drama.

32:04.840 --> 32:05.920
I'm going to dinner with her now.

32:06.560 --> 32:09.120
If she's willing to help us,
this will be settled.

32:09.920 --> 32:10.880
Ex-girlfriend?

32:12.480 --> 32:14.400
We broke up peacefully.

32:14.480 --> 32:16.440
We're still friends.

32:17.080 --> 32:18.080
Wait for my good news.

32:32.840 --> 32:34.800
Miss. Miss.

32:34.880 --> 32:36.160
Here's my contact info.

32:36.240 --> 32:37.800
Please contact me.

32:49.800 --> 32:51.280
I don't want to waste words with you.

32:51.360 --> 32:52.360
It's all because of you.

32:52.440 --> 32:55.680
If it weren't for you egging him on,
how would Fang Jin want a divorce?

32:55.760 --> 32:57.040
Su Qingli, I warn you.

32:57.120 --> 33:00.040
Stay away from Fang Jin,
or I'll make you pay.

33:01.520 --> 33:04.880
Guan Shengyu,
I think a violent man like you

33:04.960 --> 33:07.200
should marry a punching bag.

33:08.400 --> 33:09.520
I warn you.

33:10.240 --> 33:12.600
Don't lay a hand on Fang Jin again,

33:12.680 --> 33:14.400
or I'll make you regret it.

33:14.920 --> 33:17.320
- Come on. How will you make me regret it?
- What are you doing?

33:17.400 --> 33:19.560
- Show me then.
- What are you doing?

33:19.640 --> 33:22.040
- Show me.
- What are you doing? What are you doing?

33:22.120 --> 33:23.200
Don't be ungrateful.

33:23.280 --> 33:24.840
Can't you understand Chinese?

33:43.680 --> 33:45.400
If you dare harass her again,

33:45.480 --> 33:46.960
I'll twist you into a knot.

33:47.040 --> 33:47.920
Get lost.

33:51.760 --> 33:53.960
You'll regret it.

34:00.440 --> 34:01.480
Sis.

34:03.200 --> 34:04.800
- Thank you.
- Are you okay?

34:06.480 --> 34:07.520
Thank you.

34:10.520 --> 34:14.679
I didn't expect the younger girls nowadays
to be both pretty and helpful.

34:14.760 --> 34:15.639
You're so sweet.

34:18.679 --> 34:20.600
I'm pretty?

34:22.560 --> 34:23.480
Yes.

34:24.760 --> 34:27.960
I didn't expect you
to praise me for being pretty.

34:28.040 --> 34:29.480
Do you also live here?

34:34.320 --> 34:35.920
My friend lives here.

34:36.560 --> 34:38.400
- I have to go now.
- Wait a minute.

34:46.679 --> 34:47.719
Here's my name card.

34:49.040 --> 34:50.960
I hope you never have to ask me for help.

34:51.040 --> 34:53.440
If you do, I offer a 30% discount.

34:55.040 --> 34:55.840
SU QINGLI

35:45.240 --> 35:49.480
No wonder I thought that pretty girl's bag
looked familiar.

35:51.680 --> 35:52.960
Su Chengcheng.

35:53.040 --> 35:55.320
Why did you take my gym bag?

35:56.280 --> 35:57.600
I just borrowed it.

35:57.680 --> 36:00.200
I promise I'll wash it
and return it clean.

36:12.280 --> 36:14.760
It's for you. Carry it to keep you safe.

36:17.080 --> 36:18.440
DEFENSE SPRAY

36:20.040 --> 36:21.760
Why suddenly give me this?

36:22.360 --> 36:23.760
What's sudden about it?

36:23.840 --> 36:25.440
Mom's always nagging

36:25.520 --> 36:28.120
that your job is dangerous
if you meet bad people,

36:28.200 --> 36:30.000
so I thought I'd buy you
a self-defense tool.

36:42.880 --> 36:48.640
Thousand Birds Collection Cosmetics.

36:49.640 --> 36:52.880
I've used up all my strength

36:52.960 --> 36:54.680
and contacted countless clients

36:54.760 --> 36:56.960
to get you an internship opportunity.

36:57.640 --> 37:00.240
Try your best. Don't embarrass me.

37:01.360 --> 37:02.960
Thanks, sis.

37:03.040 --> 37:06.080
Go away, go away. My phone.

37:12.360 --> 37:13.720
Hello?

37:13.800 --> 37:14.880
Hello?

37:14.960 --> 37:17.240
I'm Cheng Shu, assistant to the GM
of Thousand Birds Collection.

37:17.320 --> 37:18.680
Is this Ms. Su?

37:21.440 --> 37:24.160
We have some work matters
we'd like to discuss with you.

37:24.240 --> 37:25.560
Please hold on.

37:26.520 --> 37:28.440
Thousand Birds Collection. It's for you.

37:32.240 --> 37:33.600
Hello?

37:33.680 --> 37:34.840
Hello, Ms. Su.

37:34.920 --> 37:37.800
Do you have time to come
to the company tomorrow?

37:38.520 --> 37:40.800
We'd like to meet in person
to discuss some work matters.

37:41.520 --> 37:43.600
Since the work schedule is tight,

37:43.680 --> 37:46.040
we urgently hope you can come here ASAP.

37:46.120 --> 37:47.600
I'm available.

37:47.680 --> 37:49.400
I can start working tomorrow.

37:50.200 --> 37:51.480
How about 9:30 a.m.?

37:51.560 --> 37:53.760
Sure, I'll be there on time.

37:54.600 --> 37:55.840
Okay, goodbye.

37:57.360 --> 37:59.880
Sis, they value me so much.

38:01.440 --> 38:03.440
Thanks, sis.

38:04.480 --> 38:05.880
So disgusting.

38:06.880 --> 38:08.760
Ms. Su is willing to come tomorrow.

38:10.880 --> 38:12.360
Sounds like she's passionate
about the work.

38:12.440 --> 38:14.680
And she's ready to start immediately.

38:15.280 --> 38:16.160
Great!

38:16.240 --> 38:17.240
Let's arrange the audition tomorrow.

38:17.320 --> 38:20.400
If everything goes well,
we can sign the contract right after.

38:20.480 --> 38:23.040
Is Ms. Su really willing to do it?

38:23.120 --> 38:25.960
She sounds very happy
and is very cooperative.

38:37.240 --> 38:38.920
Maybe something happened,

38:39.000 --> 38:41.000
and she accidentally lost
your contact info,

38:41.080 --> 38:42.880
so she didn't contact you first.

38:45.280 --> 38:47.400
Send me her name and contact details.

38:47.480 --> 38:48.320
Okay.

38:53.480 --> 38:55.600
The gym only knows her last name is Su.

38:55.680 --> 38:57.240
They don't know her full name.

38:58.040 --> 39:01.440
I was too eager to ask earlier. Should I…?

39:02.320 --> 39:03.240
Never mind.

39:04.760 --> 39:06.400
We'll find out tomorrow.

39:06.480 --> 39:07.440
Okay.

39:40.000 --> 39:42.720
TANG QI

39:48.360 --> 39:49.480
Lin Yuan, I found it.

39:51.600 --> 39:52.680
I got Tang Qi's QQ number.

39:53.320 --> 39:57.240
His handwritten contact info
belongs to me now.

39:57.880 --> 40:00.560
But you still need
the courage to talk to him, right?

40:00.640 --> 40:02.040
What's the use
of just having the QQ number?

40:04.320 --> 40:06.800
Instead of saying those fake words
to try to fool her,

40:07.680 --> 40:09.880
why don't you make Su Chengcheng reflect

40:09.960 --> 40:12.080
on why she made herself look so messy?

40:12.160 --> 40:13.640
Here's my contact info.

40:15.680 --> 40:16.880
Please contact me.

40:16.960 --> 40:19.600
What do you think of my face now?

40:20.320 --> 40:21.160
Very beautiful.

40:21.240 --> 40:23.120
Why did you take a picture of me?

40:24.640 --> 40:25.600
You look so bad.

40:33.600 --> 40:37.280
Tang Qi, from today on,

40:37.840 --> 40:39.400
I don't like you anymore.

40:46.120 --> 40:46.960
ALL PHOTOS

41:24.480 --> 41:29.560
NAME

41:29.640 --> 41:32.000
NEW CONTACT

41:32.080 --> 41:33.760
ANGEL SU

42:24.760 --> 42:27.840
BEAUTY FILTER, OUTFIT, EFFECT

42:29.240 --> 42:30.080
BEAUTY FILTER

42:30.160 --> 42:32.680
HAIR, EYEBROW SHAPING, SCAR REMOVAL

42:35.160 --> 42:36.240
SCAR REMOVAL

42:40.520 --> 42:42.480
ACNE REMOVAL

42:50.520 --> 42:53.640
This shouldn't be
considered cheating, right?

43:14.400 --> 43:17.080
Hello. My name is Su Chengcheng.

43:17.160 --> 43:20.400
Cheng Shu called me yesterday
and asked me to come to work today.

43:29.360 --> 43:32.640
Secretary Cheng, Ms. Su has arrived,

43:33.480 --> 43:34.680
but…

43:34.760 --> 43:36.000
No buts.

43:36.080 --> 43:37.160
Take her to do her makeup.

43:37.240 --> 43:38.560
Everyone's waiting.

43:39.520 --> 43:40.480
Okay.

43:43.520 --> 43:45.120
- Please follow me.
- Sure.

43:52.080 --> 43:53.320
You'll make the final decision.

43:53.400 --> 43:54.240
Alright.

43:57.960 --> 43:59.920
Mr. Tang, Ms. Su has arrived.

44:00.000 --> 44:01.880
She's doing her makeup
and will be here soon.

44:02.480 --> 44:03.320
Alright.

44:07.880 --> 44:11.080
I hope your ordinary girl
is better than my celebrity.

44:11.920 --> 44:13.560
I trust my judgment.

44:21.000 --> 44:22.560
Mr. Tang, Mr. Gu.

44:24.800 --> 44:26.040
Ms. Su has arrived.

44:44.560 --> 44:46.800
Is this your amateur model?

45:09.480 --> 45:11.040
Why are you pretending to be Ms. Su?

45:11.960 --> 45:13.640
I am Ms. Su.

45:13.720 --> 45:16.000
I'm here to intern
in your Marketing Department,

45:16.080 --> 45:18.920
but your employees
dragged me to do makeup,

45:19.000 --> 45:21.040
saying I'm an amateur model.

45:22.000 --> 45:24.400
Are you Su Qingli's sister?

45:25.200 --> 45:26.240
Yes.

45:28.160 --> 45:29.640
Cheng Shu, you made a mistake.

45:30.360 --> 45:32.440
Sorry, it's my fault.

45:32.520 --> 45:33.920
I didn't check.

45:34.960 --> 45:35.960
Wang Yi,

45:36.720 --> 45:38.560
when you saw her,
did you feel something was off?

45:41.440 --> 45:44.720
I thought Mr. Tang liked this type.

45:48.960 --> 45:50.720
I like her? Her type?

45:50.800 --> 45:52.240
What's wrong with me?

45:57.200 --> 45:58.800
It can't possibly be the type I like.

46:17.280 --> 46:19.160
What are you waiting for? Go find someone.

46:24.360 --> 46:26.400
It's just a big blunder.

46:58.920 --> 47:01.600
You must've never seen her
stare at you cracking walnuts.

47:03.840 --> 47:05.240
I don't know what you're talking about.

47:30.840 --> 47:31.680
Remember.

47:31.760 --> 47:33.600
Look directly into his eyes.

47:33.680 --> 47:35.560
Don't avoid it. Keep smiling.

47:35.640 --> 47:38.240
Use a friendly, gentle tone
to express your concern.

47:38.320 --> 47:41.440
I'll say the third year
of high school is tough.

47:41.520 --> 47:43.120
I heard walnuts are good for the brain.

47:43.800 --> 47:46.120
This walnut is a local specialty
from my hometown.

47:46.200 --> 47:47.720
- It's very delicious.
- Right.

47:47.800 --> 47:51.120
Once you start talking,
the conversation will flow naturally.
